[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a ramp.</p><p>1. Undo the fixing nuts (1a) and disconnect the electrical cables (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004210\">See A001 BATTERY</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Loosen the nut (2a) and disconnect the positive battery terminal (2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004210\">See A001 BATTERY</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002977.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Open the protective cover for the electrical cables connected to the starter motor.</p><p>1. Undo the fixing nut (1a) and disconnect the electrical cable (1b), starter motor side.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Starter&#x27; motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004247\">See A020 STARTER MOTOR</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002978.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Release the cable between the battery and the starter motor from the retaining bands and remove it.</p>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check the condition of the cable.</p><p>If necessary, conduct a continuity test.</p><p>Position the cable and secure it using the retaining bands.</p><p>Connect the cable to the starter motor and tighten the fixing nut to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Starter&#x27; motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004247\">See A020 STARTER MOTOR</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000656.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>BATTERY/MOTOR LEAD</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(starter motor) 2.4</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Close the protective cover for the connections on the starter motor.</p><p>1. Connect the electrical cables (1a) and tighten the fixing nuts (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004210\">See A001 BATTERY</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Connect the positive battery terminal (2a) and tighten the nut (2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004210\">See A001 BATTERY</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002979.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"]]